# Add the DOI of the archived release under `identifiers` once Zenodo has
# minted it, and keep `version` and `date-released` in step with the git tag.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "lv-ascent-model: a two-dimensional ascent model of a launch vehicle with parametric pitch programmes"
abstract: >-
  A model of the powered ascent of a launch vehicle from lift-off to orbit
  insertion. The vehicle flies a prescribed pitch programme; the model
  integrates the resulting trajectory, reports the orbit reached, and accounts
  for the velocity spent against gravity, against the air, and on steering the
  thrust away from the velocity in order to fly the programme. Three pitch
  programmes and three launch vehicles are included.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Keba
    given-names: Ruslan
    email: rukeba@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Oles Honchar Dnipro National University"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rukeba/lv-ascent-model"
keywords:
  - launch vehicle
  - ascent trajectory
  - pitch programme
  - steering loss
  - astrodynamics
